{
  "logo": null,
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p class=\"_p_nvzmr_104\" style=\"margin:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:6px 0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:600;\"><span>About our brand and products:</span></strong><span> Longevity is a premium consumer electronics accessories brand specializing in high-quality phone cases, mouse pads, stand holders, and tech gear. We offer a curated selection of stylish, functional accessories designed to enhance and protect your everyday devices.</span></p><p class=\"_p_nvzmr_104\" style=\"margin:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:6px 0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:600;\"><span>What makes us different:</span></strong><span> We focus on quality and durability with carefully selected products that combine sleek design with practical functionality. Our fast fulfillment and reliable customer service ensure a smooth experience for both affiliates and their audiences.</span></p><p class=\"_p_nvzmr_104\" style=\"margin:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:6px 0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:600;\"><span>How affiliates can earn:</span></strong><span> Earn competitive commissions on every sale you generate through your unique affiliate link. Track your performance in real-time and receive timely payouts for all qualified purchases.</span></p><p class=\"_p_nvzmr_104\" style=\"margin:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:6px 0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:600;\"><span>How to promote us:</span></strong><span> Share your affiliate links through social media, blogs, YouTube reviews, or email newsletters. Our product range appeals to tech enthusiasts, remote workers, students, and anyone looking to upgrade their device accessories. High-quality product images and promotional materials are available to support your campaigns.</span></p><p class=\"_p_nvzmr_104\" style=\"margin:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:normal;padding:6px 0px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:600;\"><span>Other information:</span></strong><span> We're committed to supporting our affiliate partners with responsive communication and marketing resources. Join us in helping customers find the perfect accessories to complement their tech lifestyle.</span></p></div></div>",
